  "title": "Double Quick Dinner Rolls",
  "description": "Muffin tins take some of the work out of these light and flaky dinner rolls made with instant potatoes and onion.",
  "authors": [
    "Marian Collins"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-08-09T23:34:58-04:00",
